<p>Your alchemist bombs now affect a radius of <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5">2, 3, 4, 5, 6</acronym> around them.</p><p>Explosion damage may increase by 0% (if the explosion is not contained) to <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5">27%, 40%, 61%, 101%, 216%</acronym> if the area of effect is confined.</p>